<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5548] bin/zeppelin.sh doesn&apos;t fully load Hadoop classpaths</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5548</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The `bin/zeppelin.sh` startup script doesn&apos;t fully load the Hadoop classpaths in the same way that `bin/zeppelin-daemon.sh` does.  As a result, anything that depends on the Hadoop classpaths being loaded (e.g. Shiro&apos;s KnoxJwtRealm) will fail.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
